<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:56:00Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Germany news: Economy set for stronger growth, wine harvest hit by drought</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f775870d242902ffe8a16bd39880981720aad3b53f27c22b7c5e527c5b781de</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T06:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-economy-set-for-stronger-growth-wine-harvest-hit-by-drought/live-79647092--5957f7bd3793.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-economy-set-for-stronger-growth-wine-harvest-hit-by-drought/live-79647092?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's economic outlook is looking a little brighter, with the International Monetary Fund almost doubling its growth forecast. However, Germany's winegrowers are facing another disappointing harvest. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What is holding back Cyprus's Schengen ambitions?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3ad384eb99bc4781ea8f30bd2178d05d94522bd5de4bdce94d29804e5d78ab75</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:42Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T06:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-is-holding-back-cyprus-s-schengen-ambitions/a-79641488--5f69812ab764.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-is-holding-back-cyprus-s-schengen-ambitions/a-79641488?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Commission says Cyprus is ready to join the Schengen Area. Yet questions relating to the island's division and British military bases could still complicate its path to Europe's border-free travel zone.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India opposition to huddle over tea after thousands march in their Delhi protest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a6207a461cffab5ae3253169c25a53647dd6ee3e3f6d0065e4f84beecea83d68</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T06:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-opposition-to-huddle-over-tea-after-thousands-march-in-their-delhi-protest/live-79646819--1e6396b5ea86.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-opposition-to-huddle-over-tea-after-thousands-march-in-their-delhi-protest/live-79646819?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Congress' Rahul Gandhi will reportedly host oppositon MPs for tea after rallying thousands in Monday's election protest. The 'Cockroach' movement says its leaders have been detained during a flash protest. Follow DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Starlink India launch: Why Elon Musk is still waiting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:280b401676ac697dc1657653276f4ec6853e0c9a2e09f2815be73555d92d013d</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T14:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/starlink-india-launch-why-elon-musk-is-still-waiting/a-79643043--4f745799dbba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/starlink-india-launch-why-elon-musk-is-still-waiting/a-79643043?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite securing key approvals, the Starlink satellite internet service remains in regulatory limbo, raising questions about security clearances, competition and India’s investment climate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>US: Man killed in Six Flags roller coaster incident</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:660cb30c6b2584dc2e23fc4712a71d8c7660e7910445cf9a9d686d5cf80d1e0c</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:48Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T03:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-man-killed-in-six-flags-roller-coaster-incident/a-79646793--8440d4cf3061.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-man-killed-in-six-flags-roller-coaster-incident/a-79646793?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Local media showed passengers being evacuated from the Goliath coaster, which reaches a maximum height of 61 meters and speeds of up to 113 km/h.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Breaking Bad' actor and disability advocate RJ Mitte dies</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:63d6d88e6453cee62395afa48e649ca66cb9900285b5036e2551e39290382ec9</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:51Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T01:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/breaking-bad-actor-and-disability-advocate-rj-mitte-dies/a-79646725--2e0d60b653fa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/breaking-bad-actor-and-disability-advocate-rj-mitte-dies/a-79646725?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">RJ Mitte said his lived experience with cerebral palsy was an asset for his role as Walter White's son Flynn on "Breaking Bad."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK: Iran 'highly likely' to be behind RAF Fairford incident</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:79877bd988434c7550bbcddb5c151c6140c197e319645115b366ccd4d70b4a74</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:54Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T19:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-iran-highly-likely-to-be-behind-raf-fairford-incident/a-79645941--7cd1b910595f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-iran-highly-likely-to-be-behind-raf-fairford-incident/a-79645941?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Prime Minister Andy Burnham told parliament there were "strong indications" of Iranian involvement. The government summoned Iran's ambassador. The scare at RAF Fairford led to the withdrawal of USAF B-1 heavy bombers.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Hundreds of French supermarkets hit by a cyberattack that  defrosted refrigeration systems</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8b537bb1f48ed4ade01abf6310a0f228fe258df5557c69d7599763976785feaa</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:55:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T18:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hundreds-of-french-supermarkets-hit-by-a-cyberattack-that-defrosted-refrigeration-systems/a-79646097--df120aaad0cd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hundreds-of-french-supermarkets-hit-by-a-cyberattack-that-defrosted-refrigeration-systems/a-79646097?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hundreds of French supermarkets saw their refrigeration systems defrosted, spoiling tons of frozen food. The unprecedented attack has raised serious questions about food security across Europe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland reports arrests of 2 Turkish citizens in Germany in connection with Starlink station fire last month</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7764edf3323dcae35d54ea880ef8f7988fd04dbf4ab77004bc62c458ec0736ac</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:56:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T18:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-reports-arrests-of-2-turkish-citizens-in-germany-in-connection-with-starlink-station-fire-las/a-79646138--0f2bfafb19a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-reports-arrests-of-2-turkish-citizens-in-germany-in-connection-with-starlink-station-fire-last-month/a-79646138?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Polish authorities have reported the arrests of two Turkish citizens in Germany in connection with alleged sabotage of a Starlink station last month. Prime Minister Donald Tusk called the fire an act of "hybrid warfare."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Fact check: Viral videos falsely linked to Riyadh airport attacks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fe9d65bcca9c5ea23c10632eba6840d14bbd14ff6459f2d10cbb143896319a14</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T17:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fact-check-viral-videos-falsely-linked-to-riyadh-airport-attacks/a-79643037--a62cb3e36a4c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fact-check-viral-videos-falsely-linked-to-riyadh-airport-attacks/a-79643037?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Many videos claiming to show an attack on Riyadh's King Khalid International Airport have gone viral online. DW Fact check analyzes some of the most-shared footage and finds evidence it was created using AI.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Labor Minister's resignation puts a spotlight on cracks within the government</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3060fa754ae079aa391d4bdd03e0956737b4fe7f6c3fdbf8feb7af6e625e0437</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T17:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-labor-minister-s-resignation-puts-a-spotlight-on-cracks-within-the-government/a-79645823--1507ba6fa4a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-labor-minister-s-resignation-puts-a-spotlight-on-cracks-within-the-government/a-79645823?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following the sudden resignation of Bärbel Bas as Labor Minister and co-chair of the Social Democratic Party, accusations are flying in Chancellor Merz's coalition government.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Merz says Trump's Russia diesel deal 'out of question' for Europe</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d578dcd67b06f53f3480a27cb089a5bfbce7a3186e4387ab4ab4e2e833786061</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T16:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-says-trump-s-russia-diesel-deal-out-of-question-for-europe/live-79636427--1a9438e4fa1b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-says-trump-s-russia-diesel-deal-out-of-question-for-europe/live-79636427?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Chancellor Friedrich Merz has said that Donald Trump's diesel deal with Russia would be "out of the question" for Germany and the EU. Meanwhile, the ruling coalition has been rocked by a major resignation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US federal agents search home of Trump critic Ilhan Omar</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8741766ece22ffc7fcb521122d8ce08da7c284d5887bc6a3a2ac436c124ef5b0</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T15:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-federal-agents-search-home-of-trump-critic-ilhan-omar/a-79643360--b11b8361cb7e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-federal-agents-search-home-of-trump-critic-ilhan-omar/a-79643360?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Justice Department officials said the Washington residence of Democratic Congresswoman Ilhan Omar, an outspoken opponent of President Trump, was raided as "part of an ongoing federal investigation."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pope lung nodule: Could it be cancer?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6b2b6c4722d9ab777226e5bbee65b5a885916cbf0eaafbcd053bf6b1a1ff4b63</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T14:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pope-lung-nodule-could-it-be-cancer/a-79641503--9cf198017761.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pope-lung-nodule-could-it-be-cancer/a-79641503?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The case of Pope Leo shows how small lung nodules are often found during routine health checks. Quick treatment is generally advised before nodules can grow to become larger life-threatening masses.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Can South Korea and Ukraine resolve their diplomatic spat over North Korean POWs?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5e0a30025c83f94430fb7ed1a1db1e4e039e527f7d63a77a531f032caa11e108</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T13:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-south-korea-and-ukraine-resolve-their-diplomatic-spat-over-north-korean-pows/a-79641352--b03ac996f9c5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-south-korea-and-ukraine-resolve-their-diplomatic-spat-over-north-korean-pows/a-79641352?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Seoul and Kyiv are trading accusations after the transfer of two North Korean POWs to South Korea. The South insists the move was to be kept secret as it seeks to avoid antagonizing Pyongyang.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine says Russia launched strikes hours after Donald Trump announced an 'energy ceasefire'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:144df8f88dfc548162bf981615dae8a5fd2d2d4c2c178445a9ebfbee1b023618</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T11:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-says-russia-launched-strikes-hours-after-donald-trump-announced-an-energy-ceasefire/a-79640911--e71f7886c231.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-says-russia-launched-strikes-hours-after-donald-trump-announced-an-energy-ceasefire/a-79640911?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Less than 24 hours after Donald Trump announced an "energy ceasefire," Ukraine reported Russian strikes in Kyiv, Kharkiv and Donetsk. The Kremlin says it would only consider a one-day ceasefire for an election.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's Wadephul calls new EU sanctions 'unprecedented' blow to Russia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:36f14cb99f5eaf3925e63b845da553be49739b2f344f86eb0bdbc06ea181a72d</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T10:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-wadephul-calls-new-eu-sanctions-unprecedented-blow-to-russia/a-79638017--5ed7d4a3c799.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-wadephul-calls-new-eu-sanctions-unprecedented-blow-to-russia/a-79638017?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Union has approved its largest-ever sanctions package against Moscow, targeting more than 1,000 entities tied to the military-industrial complex. The move took place in an EU foreign ministers' meeting.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia: Deadly Houthi strikes on Riyadh airport fuel fears of wider Middle East conflict</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6625b6bcf011fc8c95c8ceff7e4a466988256361a19486f03ca9aeb8d6bb1516</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T10:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-deadly-houthi-strikes-on-riyadh-airport-fuel-fears-of-wider-middle-east-conflict/live-79639277--e5c36dea696a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-deadly-houthi-strikes-on-riyadh-airport-fuel-fears-of-wider-middle-east-conflict/live-79639277?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Riyadh airport will remain closed at least until the weekend amid deadly strikes by Yemen-based Houthis. The US has said it is weighing joining Saudi military operations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nobel Prize in Economics goes to pair of US economists</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b0ec9a1153964d9f712b21ff95118a33138220078c9f4a3e38aa8ff6e18e0724</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T09:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nobel-prize-in-economics-goes-to-pair-of-us-economists/a-79638025--d32b949e2ca9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nobel-prize-in-economics-goes-to-pair-of-us-economists/a-79638025?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Robert E. Hall and Michael Woodford got the Nobel for developing economic models that help governments and central banks respond more effectively to booms and recessions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Opposition parties march to Supreme Court</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66ef6eda923694fa1b789d64a1ed2eb9075abeaec934c6a87218b816daf4e9b4</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T09:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-opposition-parties-march-to-supreme-court/live-79638649--6608bc6a2872.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-opposition-parties-march-to-supreme-court/live-79638649?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Intensifying their demand for Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar's resignation, opposition parties are holding a march to the Supreme Court. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's women: Ena Mahmutovic makes her case to become Germany's next No.1 goalkeeper</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0c2d2eb38a84ce8925e563219b32925f776a3cf4f3eb1c15889705a678a13c98</id><updated>2026-10-13T06:54:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T09:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-women-ena-mahmutovic-makes-her-case-to-become-germany-s-next-no-1-goalkeeper/a-79609341--71931b21638e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-women-ena-mahmutovic-makes-her-case-to-become-germany-s-next-no-1-goalkeeper/a-79609341?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's win against Australia saw Ena Mahmutovic excel in goal. The 22-year-old Bayern Munich goalkeeper is considered the successor to Ann-Katrin Berger and is making a name for herself.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
